		{
			dependencies: ["1229F8883A381F07"]
			description: [
				"The following items are required to set up an Ars Nouveau storage system."
				""
				"- Storage Lectern"
				"- Bookwyrm Charms"
				"- Dominion Wand"
				"- Chest or Barrel"
				""
				"At least 1 of each is required."
				""
				"First, right click the Storage Lectern with a Bookwyrm Charm in your main hand. This will summon a Bookwyrm that is linked to that Storage Lectern."
				""
				"After that, sneak + right click with the Dominion Wand in your main hand on the Storage Lectern. Do the same to a Chest or Barrel to link it to the Storage Lectern."
				""
				"A Sophisticated Storage Controller with Sophisticated Storage's storage blocks allows easier interfacing so you don't have to repeat the above step multiple times for each storage block."
			]
			id: "16A0492D4152E409"
